    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d649">

                <pb facs="0627" n="455" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg455"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/6396</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-08-11T23:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 11, 1917, 11 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received August 12, 11.45
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The action suggested in my telegram of August 9, 4 [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >8</hi>] p.m., would accord with expectations of China to complete our
                    original invitation to sever diplomatic relations with Germany.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
